    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>2nd-level Study of Arcane feature</em></p><p>You gain the ability to conserve and enhance your mage abilities beyond the norm. Whenever you cast a mage spell of 1st level or higher, gain an arcane charge of the equivalent level up to 5th level. Spells slots higher than 5th give a 5th level arcane charge. These charges last until they are used, replaced by a higher level charge, or after 1 minute has passed.</p><p>You may expend an arcane charge to grant yourself one of the following effects. This effect lasts until the end of your next turn.</p><ul><li><p>As a bonus action, you can add a bonus equal to the arcane charge's level to Attack and Damage rolls for your next Mage Spell.</p></li><li><p>As a bonus action or reaction, you can add a bonus equal to the arcane charge's level to Saving Throws against Magic or Magical Effects.</p></li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
